      "sourceTextSha256": "4f6bc28d2dab88f4774f5604de2690fbecba6af77ad0bad9c35bb26e80667789",
      "text": "Group excursion to Mount Corcovado and Christ the Redeemer with an English-speaking guide (4 hours).\nFrom the station, an open-air train climbs through the forest to the top of Corcovado, with views of Tijuca Forest on either side of the tracks. At the summit, 710 m above sea level, stands Rio’s landmark, the 38 m Christ the Redeemer statue, completed in 1931. The viewing platform looks out over the city and its surroundings, including the bridge to Niterói, Guanabara Bay, the Botanical Garden, the Maracanã Stadium, and Sugarloaf Mountain.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw8xm7mg-7cp5ig",
